flowchart TD
    A[Job Created] --> B[Active Production]
    B --> C{Operational Completion Checklist Passed?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Operationally Complete]

    D --> E[Final Cost Reconciliation]
    D --> F[Final Collection Tracking]
    D --> G[Document and Exception Review]

    E --> E1{Labor, Materials, Returns, and Fees Final?}
    F --> F1{All Expected Funds Collected?}
    G --> G1{Required Documents Complete or Exception Approved?}

    E1 -- No --> E
    F1 -- No --> F
    G1 -- No --> G

    E1 -- Yes --> H[Financial Close Review]
    F1 -- Yes --> H
    G1 -- Yes --> H

    H --> I{Owner Approves Financial Snapshot?}
    I -- No --> E
    I -- Yes --> J[Financially Closed and Locked]

    J --> K[Generate Commission Allocations from Effective Rules]
    K --> L{Owner Approves Commission?}
    L -- No --> K
    L -- Yes --> M[Commission Payable]

    M --> N[Draws and Payment Transactions]
    N --> O{Commission Balance Zero?}
    O -- No --> P[Partially Paid / Carry-Forward Balance]
    P --> N
    O -- Yes --> Q[Commission Settled]

    Q --> R[Closed Job]
    R --> S[Closed Jobs View — Searchable and Read-Only]
    S --> T[Archived View After Retention Threshold]

    J --> U{Financial Change Required Later?}
    R --> U
    U -- No --> J
    U -- Yes --> V[Owner Reopen Request with Reason]
    V --> W[Create New Financial Version and Hold Commission Changes]
    W --> E

    X[Closed with Exception] -. owner-approved unresolved item .-> H
    X -. remains on exception dashboard .-> R
